3b1c30056ad9d20bEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_World_TalesOfTheHells</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_World_TalesOfTheHells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_World_TalesOfTheHells\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">5a963ead-1758-46f8-8b9f-61297ef61be4</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5a963ead-1758-46f8-8b9f-61297ef61be4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:5a963ead-1758-46f8-8b9f-61297ef61be4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Fee\" title=\"Devil's Fee\">Devil's Fee</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-31&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;7</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Diabolic tales collected by Greshnag the Inattentive, Impish Archivist.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><b>Entry 18 - Smiler the Defiler</b>\n</p><p>If your wanders through <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a> seem to become an awful lot more scenic - luscious woods, big bushes and the like - you may have wandered into a wily trap set by a creature named Smiler. None of us hellfolk know exactly <i>what</i> he is, where he's from, or how he got here, but he's a nasty piece of work. Well, he's called the Defiler, ain't he. He's not just nasty, plenty folk are nasty here, but he's <i>weird</i>. Something's not right.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The book continues in a similarly unenlightening fashion.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202835\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1346/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25480/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7297/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935632/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.627      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.627      1 -total\n 50.87%   20.157      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.30%   17.952     15 Template:Trim\n 24.39%    9.664      2 Template:Uid\n 16.12%    6.386      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.23%    5.640      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.51%    4.166      1 Template:Books\n  9.93%    3.935      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.84%    3.901      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12540-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202835 and revision id 346780. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}